点概要","geo":"圣萨尔瓦多岛，英语世界也作华特林岛，哥伦布记载的本名为瓜纳哈尼，是巴哈马东部的一个珊瑚岛，同时也是巴哈马的一个区。\n圣萨尔瓦多岛被学界广泛认为是1492年10月12哥伦布航行第一个到达的美洲岛屿，可以确认圣萨尔瓦多是哥伦布取的名，但具体登陆的方位有争议，且存在萨马纳岛等别说。","culture":null,"see":null,"scope":"reference","qid":"Q845540","articleTitle":"圣萨尔瓦多岛","sourceRevision":94277884,"method":"Full-article section excerpts; traditional Chinese converted to simplified; tables, citations, population and current-office statistics omitted.","attribution":"中文维基百科资料摘编、删节与繁简转换 · CC BY-SA 4.0（作者见原文历史）","sources":[["地点资料 · 圣萨尔瓦多岛","https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%9C%A3%E8%90%A8%E5%B0%94%E7%93%A6%E5%A4%9A%E5%B2%9B"],["原文版本与作者","https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94277884"],["地点身份 · Wikidata","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q845540"],["资料许可 · CC BY-SA 4.0","https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"]]}},{"id":"BS-CS","name":"中安德罗斯","english":"Central Andros","country":"BHS","lat":24.4757,"lon":-77.9355,"kind":"region","bbox":[-78.1409,24.1522,-77.6824,24.6385],"geometry":{"type":"MultiPolygon","coordinates":[[[[-77.8807,24.1863],[-77.9626,24.1522],[-77.9762,24.1868],[-77.7987,24.2546],[-77.8539,24.2347],[-77.8807,24.1863]]],[[[-77.9216,24.262],[-77.9359,24.2272],[-78.0169,24.2484],[-77.9216,24.262]]],[[[-77.7677,24.3266],[-77.8044,24.3272],[-77.7192,24.3717],[-77.6824,24.3528],[-77.7677,24.3266]]],[[[-77.7418,24.6347],[-77.7279,24.4742],[-77.8638,24.4154],[-77.8601,24.3849],[-77.9086,24.3508],[-78.0128,24.3142],[-78.0178,24.2751],[-78.0455,24.282],[-78.0801,24.3795],[-78.1409,24.4335],[-78.1344,24.5016],[-78.0718,24.5965],[-77.9424,24.6385],[-77.7418,24.6347]]],[[[-77.8692,24.3468],[-77.8328,24.3496],[-77.8673,24.3195],[-77.8692,24.3468]]]]}},{"id":"BS-MC","name":"曼格罗夫岛","english":"Mangrove Cay","country":"BHS","lat":24.0806,"lon":-77.8018,"kind":"region","bbox":[-77.942,23.9802,-77.6312,24.303],"geometry":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[-77.8226,23.9802],[-77.8601,24.0627],[-77.942,24.0969],[-77.9091,24.1053],[-77.911,24.1358],[-77.8539,24.1658],[-77.8397,24.2067],[-77.6752,24.